    <item><headword id="d0e573" type="heading" level="h1">12. Signs foretelling weather</headword></item>
    <item><headword id="d0e577" type="heading" level="h2">12.1. Foretelling good weather.</headword></item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp347088">[còta]</headword>
      <description>“An crochadh tu do chota orra [sic].” In reference to the moon. If you could hang your coat on the moon according to its shape then a good day was in prospect. If you could not then the opposite applied.</description>
